  {
   "id": "brews-bastards-265392@major-2026-02-08",
   "gameId": "brews-bastards-265392",
   "displayName": "Brews & Bastards Happy Hour Update",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2026-02-08T23:50:23.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Major Update for Brews & Bastards",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "The Happy Hour Update for Brews & Bastards is OUT NOW! We've got lots of changes big and small that we'll dig into soon, but first, wet your whistle on the update trailer!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Pub Crawl",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "The biggest addition to this update is the new Rogue-Lite gameplay mode called Pub Crawl. This mode generates random combat, trap, item, shop rooms and enemy spawns, allowing for maximum replay-ability. Players can also select difficulty and run length options, tailoring each play-through to your specific play style.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44546721/b5b4af5c6ba73dbd509258432e6bf7119c215fd2.png\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "New Brews, New Artifacts",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "A supply of new brews and artifacts have been delivered to the brewery, while some others have been tweaked for more firepower! Exploding bananas, massive fireballs, bouncing ice-cubes and more. Descend under the tavern and discover all these new goodies.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44546721/f99a00446b077f00dd9bdc55dc39aed1c8746f95.png\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Even More Features",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "But wait, there's more! We also chucked in a Drop-In Multiplayer option for those that were late to the party. A Single Stick Mode has also been added to the options menu, allowing you to aim and run with a single thumb. Speaking of options, Control Rebinding has also been included, for those that can't stand our default control scheme.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Bugs and Tweaks",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "I'm not sure how many bugs and tweaks we've made over the months since release, but it's a lot. Overall the game plays a lot smoother and brews and artifacts feel better. Cleaned up some menu stuff and collision issues. Lots. Check it out.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Cheers ta,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "-Mune Studio",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
